msgstr "preskočeno, %s"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "YAML (default)"
msgstr "YAML (podrazumijevano)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "SmokePing konfiguracija"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Vaše dozvole za uređaje ne pokrivaju sve uređaje, pa ne možete izvesti ni uvesti SmokePing konfiguraciju. Obratite se administratoru koji ima pristup svim uređajima."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Izvoz SmokePing konfiguracije"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Izvoz sadrži postavke dodatka, SmokePing ciljeve koje je dodatak pročitao i informaciju kojem je uređaju svaki cilj mapiran prema imenu hosta i opisu uređaja. Ne sadrži izvore podataka, grafikone, RRD datoteke ni pristupne podatke."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Preuzmi"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Uvoz SmokePing konfiguracije"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Odabirom datoteke vrši se samo njena provjera. Sljedeći ekran prikazuje spisak svih izmjena koje bi datoteka napravila, a ništa se ne upisuje dok ne potvrdite taj spisak. Uvoz dodaje i ažurira podatke; nikada ne briše cilj niti premješta mapiranje, i nikada ne kreira RRD datoteku niti dira SmokePing direktorij s podacima."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Provjeri datoteku"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Provjera uvoza"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ništa nije upisano."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Nazad"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Datoteka se ne može uvesti dok se ove greške ne isprave. Ništa nije upisano."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Instalacija već odgovara datoteci. Nema ništa za uvoz."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Plan %s. Primjenom se izvršavaju tačno ove izmjene u jednoj transakciji. Ako su se datoteka ili instalacija promijenile od ove provjere, uvoz se odbija i morate izvršiti ponovnu provjeru."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Primijeni uvoz"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Otkaži"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Dodaj SmokePing ciljeve"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "nema odgovarajućeg SmokePing cilja"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Kliknite Nastavi da dodate SmokePing ciljeve čiji host odgovara imenu hosta svakog odabranog uređaja. Svaki cilj dobija zbirni grafikon za alarme i, kada se SmokePing podaci mogu prikazati grafički, smoke grafikon. Uređaji se ovdje nikada ne kreiraju."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Podudara se ciljeva: %d."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Kreirano ili mapirano objekata: %d, preskočeno: %d."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Ovaj uređaj ima SmokePing ciljeve, ali čitač koji popunjava njihove zbirne vrijednosti radi na polleru %d, dok je uređaj sačuvan na polleru %d. Zbirne vrijednosti i alarmi se zaustavljaju dok se uređaj ponovo ne dodijeli polleru %d."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "SmokePing ciljevi ovog uređaja"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Smoke grafikona koji još koriste drugu šemu boja: %d; glavni poller premješta do 200 po ciklusu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Broj smoke grafikona koji se nisu mogli premjestiti: %d; pokrenite upgrade-graphs za ponovni pokušaj i provjerite Cacti zapisnik radi uzroka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Postavka Boje gubitaka traži boje gubitaka za SmokePing %s, ali je čitač pronašao SmokePing %s. Postavite na Automatski osim ako grafikoni treba da se razlikuju od SmokePing grafikona."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Postavka Boje gubitaka bira boje gubitaka za SmokePing %s na smoke grafikonima."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Čitač nije pronašao verziju SmokePinga, pa postavka Boje gubitaka bira boje gubitaka za SmokePing 2.8 i novije. Ako koristite SmokePing 2.7, postavite Boje gubitaka na SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Čitač je pronašao SmokePing %s, pa postavka Boje gubitaka bira njegove boje gubitaka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold nije instaliran, pa nijedan cilj ne šalje alarme istovremeno u SmokePingu i Tholdu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Nijedan cilj nema istovremeno SmokePing alarm i uključen Thold prag."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Broj ciljeva koji imaju i SmokePing alarm i uključen Thold prag: %d, pa jedan problem može poslati dvostruko obavještenje. Uporedite njihove uslove za alarm prije uklanjanja jednog od njih: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Uvoz SmokePing šablona nije uspio i ne pokušava se ponovo automatski: %s Nakon otklanjanja uzroka koristite Ponovi uvoz šablona."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "SmokePing šabloni nisu uvezeni. Koristite Ponovi uvoz šablona."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "SmokePing šabloni su uvezeni."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Svaki uređaj sa zbirnim izvorima podataka obrađuje poller na kojem radi čitač."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Broj uređaja (%d) sa zbirnim izvorima podataka koje ne obrađuje poller %d, na kojem radi čitač, pa njihove zbirne vrijednosti i alarmi nemaju podatke: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "SmokePing konfiguracija se čita na polleru %d, a ne na ovom serveru; red inventara prikazuje rezultat njegovog posljednjeg čitanja."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "SmokePing konfiguracija %s se ne može pročitati: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "SmokePing konfiguracija %s navodi ciljeva: %d; preskočeno stavki: %d: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "SmokePing konfiguracija %s navodi ciljeva: %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Postavka putanje do PHP izvršne datoteke je prazna ili nije izvršna datoteka, pa se čitač ne može pokrenuti."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Čitač se pokreće pomoću %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Čitač još nije dovršio nijedno izvršavanje na ovom polleru."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Posljednje izvršavanje čitača završilo je prije %d s, što je više od tri intervala pollera."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Čitač je pročitao %d od %d serija za %.1f s i prekoračio svoj vremenski budžet %d puta."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Čitač je pročitao %d od %d serija za %.1f s, prije %d s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Na ovom polleru još nije pročitan inventar."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Posljednje čitanje inventara nije uspjelo prije %d s i prethodni inventar je još u upotrebi: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Inventar je zabilježio %d ciljeva prije %d s."

#: lib/HealthPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "SmokePing Health for Poller %d"
msgstr "Stanje ispravnosti SmokePinga za poller %d"

