msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Cacti poller koji radi na SmokePing hostu ili dijeli datotečni sistem s njim. Samo ovaj poller čita SmokePing podatke."

